8. Quantifiers (🔥 Interview Favorite)
| Quantifier | Meaning   |
| ---------- | --------- |
| `?`        | 0 or 1    |
| `*`        | 0 or more |
| `+`        | 1 or more |
| `{n}`      | exactly n |
| `{n,}`     | n or more |
| `{n,m}`    | n to m    |

Example
System.out.println("aaa".matches("a+"));

Output
true

9. Anchors (Position Matching)
| Anchor | Meaning         |
| ------ | --------------- |
| `^`    | start of string |
| `$`    | end of string   |
| `\b`   | word boundary   |

System.out.println("Java".matches("^Java$"));

Output
true

10. Grouping & Alternation
Grouping ( )
System.out.println("cat".matches("(cat|dog)"));

Output
